@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
actor User
participant "Serial Terminal" as Terminal
participant "CommandInterface" as Cmd
participant "ActuatorLabApp" as App
participant "BinaryCommandConditioner" as BinCond
participant "AnalogCommandConditioner" as AnaCond
participant "BinaryActuator" as BinAct
participant "PwmActuator" as PwmAct
participant "LcdDisplay" as LCD

User -> Terminal : enter command
Terminal -> Cmd : serial bytes
Cmd -> App : completed line
App -> BinCond : submit() / or
App -> AnaCond : setTargetPercent()
App -> BinCond : tick()
BinCond -> BinAct : setState()
App -> AnaCond : tick()
AnaCond -> PwmAct : setDuty()
App -> LCD : showPage0()/showPage1()
App -> Terminal : printf status
@enduml
